-- src:18183 | (b) any document produced to be authenticated in such manner as it may reasonably require.
@ref s 1267 FSMA 89I(1)-(2) Requirements in connection with call for information (src:18180-18183)
GIVEN requirement IS A `s 1267 FSMA 89I requirement`
      `the requirement is one the competent authority may reasonably require` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 1267 FSMA 89I(1)-(2) the competent authority may impose the requirement` MEANS
    IF `the requirement is one the competent authority may reasonably require`
