    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "in such form as it may reasonably require" / "in such manner as it may reasonably require"

DECLARE `s 1267 FSMA 89I(3) step` IS ONE OF
    `s 1267 FSMA 89I(3)(a) take copies of or extracts from the document`
    `s 1267 FSMA 89I(3)(b) require the person producing the document, or any relevant person, to provide an explanation of the document`

-- src:18184 | (3) If a document is produced in response to a requirement imposed under section 89H, the competent authority may—
-- src:18185 | (a) take copies of or extracts from the document; or
-- src:18186 | (b) require the person producing the document, or any relevant person, to provide an explanation of the document.
@ref s 1267 FSMA 89I(3) Requirements in connection with call for information: copies and explanations (src:18184-18186)
GIVEN step IS A `s 1267 FSMA 89I(3) step`
      `a document is produced in response to a requirement imposed under section 89H` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 1267 FSMA 89I(3) the competent authority may take the step` MEANS
    IF `a document is produced in response to a requirement imposed under section 89H`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "If a document is produced in response to a requirement imposed under section 89H, the competent authority may" (name test of 2026-11-12, fork F-Q8)

-- src:18187 | (4) In subsection (3)(b) “relevant person”, in relation to a person who is required to produce a document, means a person who—
-- src:18188 | (a) has been or is a director or controller of that person;
-- src:18189 | (b) has been or is an auditor of that person;
-- src:18190 | (c) has been or is an actuary, accountant or lawyer appointed or instructed by that person; or
-- src:18191 | (d) has been or is an employee of that person.
@ref s 1267 FSMA 89I(4) Requirements in connection with call for information: "relevant person" (src:18187-18191)
GIVEN `the person has been or is a director or controller of the person required to produce the document` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person has been or is an auditor of that person` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person has been or is an actuary, accountant or lawyer appointed or instructed by that person` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person has been or is an employee of that person` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 1267 FSMA 89I(4) the person is a relevant person` MEANS
    IF       `the person has been or is a director or controller of the person required to produce the document`
          OR `the person has been or is an auditor of that person`
          OR `the person has been or is an actuary, accountant or lawyer appointed or instructed by that person`
          OR `the person has been or is an employee of that person`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“relevant person”, in relation to a person who is required to produce a document, means a person who"

