GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 1267 FSMA 89J(3) the matter is specified` MEANS
    IF `the matter is specified in the notice`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“specified” means specified in the notice"

-- src:18199 | “voteholder” means a person who—
