    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "The competent authority may extend the period within which representations may be made to it"

-- src:18254 | (5) If, having considered any representations made to it, the competent authority decides to maintain, vary or revoke its earlier decision, it must give written notice to that effect to the person mentioned in subsection (2).
@ref s 1268 FSMA 89M(5) Procedure under section 89L: the decision (src:18254-18254)
GIVEN `having considered any representations made to it, the competent authority decides to maintain, vary or revoke its earlier decision` IS A BOOLEAN
